%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: SayuriIntermission3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675473
    - rid: 4351268399126675474
    - rid: 4351268399126675475
    - rid: 4351268399126675479
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: So, where <i>are</i> the two of you from?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675476
    - rid: 4351268399126675477
    - rid: 4351268399126675478
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: I've never seen Nords or any other of the races of men with your hair
      color...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675480
    - rid: 4351268399126675481
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uh, should we tell her?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Would she even believe us?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: And you're definitely not Mer... your ears are rounded.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you perhaps from Akavir, or even Pyandonea?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Where?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675483
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Other continents here on Nirn, maybe?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675482
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, no... we're not from either of those places...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675484
    - rid: 4351268399126675485
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: If not there, then where?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: We're from Japanifornia!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675486
    - rid: 4351268399126675487
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: ... where?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Sayori, we don't know what'll happen if we tell them the truth!)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Eh, I'm sure it'll be fine. I told my master back in Whiterun about
      when I first woke up and nothing bad happened.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675488
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Specifically, Sakura, Japanifornia.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685696
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: Jah-pan-ih-forn-ya?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685697
    - rid: 4351268418678685698
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685699
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: It <i>is</i> a bit of a mouthful, isn't it, ehehe...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685700
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But, that's just what happens when two different types of people are
      forced to live with each other, I guess.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685701
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... they sort of glossed over it during history class...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685702
    - rid: 4351268418678685703
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Why do you think that is, Yuri?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685704
    - rid: 4351268418678685705
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, the atrocities committed by the Soviets onto the Japanese mainland
      aren't exactly age-appropriate for high schoolers.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685706
    - rid: 4351268418678685707
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... like what?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685708
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: There were the Hokkaido firestorms...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685709
    - rid: 4351268418678685710
    - rid: 4351268418678685711
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: The glassing of Nagasaki...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685712
    - rid: 4351268418678685713
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: The perpetual acid rain over Tokyo...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685714
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I think mom said her parents were from Tokyo...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That certainly explains the burn marks on their faces...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685715
    - rid: 4351268418678685716
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ... oh, I didn't know-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: It's alright Yuri... I'm sorry I asked.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685717
    - rid: 4351268418678685718
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: ... what?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685719
    - rid: 4351268418678685720
    - rid: 4351268418678685722
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry Brelyna, kinda forgot you were here, ehehe...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685723
    - rid: 4351268418678685726
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: The Soviets? Nagasaki? Acid rain-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: 'No, I''m sorry, let''s just start with Japanfornia: where <i>is</i>
      that, exactly?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685724
    - rid: 4351268418678685725
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Japanifornia travels along the west coast of the North America-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685727
    - rid: 4351268418678685728
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Surrounded by Japanada and Canada to the north...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: The United Commonwealths to the east...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: And Mexico to the south!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685729
    - rid: 4351268418678685731
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: All of those places are making me <i>more</i> lost...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685730
    - rid: 4351268418678685732
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, that's where we're from!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685733
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: ... some obscure plane of Oblivion?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: No.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: Aetherius?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: No.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: Masser? Secunda? Any of the other planets-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: No, our planet is called Earth.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ce26110965197241908f3f9f7ef5410, type: 2}
    dialog: ?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685734
    - rid: 4351268418678685735
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
